# deck path: <root>/convivy-deck/ is the deck lab product (ARCH-382). PR #446
# took convivy-deck out of LOCAL_AGENT_REPOS, so `agentctl spawn` resolves
# deck's agents THROUGH the shared KB index like every other product, and
# `deck/daytime` renders all three plus its skills — this half of the old note
# was correct and is why a DISPATCHED deck agent has always gotten the
# profile.
